    suggestedQuestion: How was your relationship with Daniel Reyes?
    stance: 1
    truth: Reyes was secretly negotiating a sale that would have forced Marlowe out.
    answers:
    - We built that firm together. Eighteen years. He was my partner.
    - Partners disagree. We always worked it out.
    followUpAnswer: Because that's what partners do. You wouldn't understand.
    pressuredAnswer: He wanted to sell the firm. Behind my back. To people who'd
      have pushed me out within a year.
    contradictedByEvidence: []
    admissionAnswer: 
    requiresTopic: 
    requiresEvidence: 
    priority: 3
