    suggestedQuestion: Who had keys to the office?
    stance: 0
    truth: Reyes, Marlowe, Hayes; Kim's card was never cancelled.
    answers:
    - Daniel, me, Nora. And Victor still had a card. Daniel should have had it cancelled
